      '**PMG teaches missionaries to help investigators recognize the Spirit. Based on D&C 8, how would you describe what receiving a spiritual witness feels like to someone who has never experienced it?**',
      '**Oliver was told he had already received revelation but didn\u2019t recognize it. What revelations might you be receiving but dismissing as \u201cjust my own thoughts\u201d?**',
