    themes: ['Suffering', 'Priesthood Authority', 'Christlike Character', 'Patience', "God\u2019s Awareness"],
    notable: { v: '41\u201342', text: 'No power or influence can or ought to be maintained by virtue of the priesthood, only by persuasion, by long-suffering, by gentleness and meekness, and by love unfeigned; by kindness, and pure knowledge, which shall greatly enlarge the soul without hypocrisy, and without guile.', note: 'The most complete description of Christlike leadership in the Restoration scriptures. It applies to anyone who leads \u2014 parents, teachers, missionaries, friends.' },
