    summary: 'Addressed to Oliver Cowdery, Section 6 confirms his calling, teaches that God knows the thoughts and intents of our hearts, and declares that eternal life is the greatest gift of God. The Lord reveals that peace spoken to the mind is itself a form of divine witness, and closes with His own declaration: "I am Jesus Christ."',
    themes: ['Revelation', 'Peace of Mind', 'Gift of Eternal Life', 'Testimony', 'Doubt Not', 'Christ Speaks'],
